type: software
title: "lidar-strip-adjust"
abstract: >
  Automated boresight calibration and strip adjustment for airborne and UAV
  LiDAR point clouds using planar-neighbourhood point-to-plane ICP and
  Levenberg–Marquardt optimisation.
